   "en": "I Cultivate Both God and Demon Dominating the World"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "我神魔双修：制霸当世"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the era of myriad races, different species fight against each other to seize more resources, even going so far as to wage wars. Amidst the bloody battles and endless scheming, as the ancient human race fades into the river of history, a new human race rises through bloodshed, fighting for survival...",
   "zh": "万族时代，为争夺更多资源，不同种族之间互相争斗，甚至不惜掀起大战。在血雨腥风和尔虞我诈的时代里，随着古人族消失在历史长河中，新的人族踏着鲜血崛起，为了生存而战......"
  },
